# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true wants CRLF in the
# working tree while the repository stores LF. Files then get reported as
# modified forever even though their content is identical to HEAD, and the
# noise hides real changes. Pinning the ending here keeps the result the same
# for everyone regardless of their local git settings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never line-ending convert binary assets or build output.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
